  "notes": "さくさく is a versatile onomatopoeia with both food-related and abstract meanings.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- さくさくした{食感|しょっかん}: crispy texture\n- さくさく{進|すす}む: to progress smoothly\n- さくさく{動|うご}く: to run smoothly (computers, devices)\n\nCONTRAST WITH OTHER CRUNCHY SOUNDS:\n- ぱりぱり: crispy (dry, like chips)\n- ばりばり: hard crunching\n- しゃきしゃき: fresh crispness (vegetables)",
